$ Milestone 6, §3.6: a `bring`-able module. Per driver.cpp's ModuleMerger,
$ a module file may only contain job declarations (and its own `bring`s)
$ at the top level -- no loose executable statements.

job area(width, height) {
    give width * height
}

job perimeter(width, height) {
    give (width + height) * 2
}
